ing for high-stakes reliability.‚Äù","‚ÄúRed Teaming Language Models to Reduce Harms: Methods, Scaling Behaviors, and Lessons Learned.‚Äù","‚ÄúRed Teaming Language Models with Language Models.‚Äù","‚ÄúRed Teaming Language Models to Reduce Harms: Methods, Scaling Behaviors, and Lessons Learned.‚Äù","‚ÄúFLIRT: Feedback Loop In-context Red Teaming.‚Äù","‚ÄúExplore, Establish, Exploit: Red Teaming Language Models from Scratch.‚Äù","‚ÄúDefending ChatGPT against Jailbreak Attack via Self-Reminder.‚Äù","‚ÄúAutomatically Auditing Large Language Models via Discrete Optimization.‚Äù","‚ÄúCompromising Real-World LLM-Integrated Applications with Indirect Prompt Injection.‚Äù","‚ÄúBaseline Defenses for Adversarial Attacks Against Aligned Language Models.‚Äù","‚ÄúJailbroken: How Does LLM Safety Training Fail?‚Äù","‚ÄúEDA: Easy data augmentation techniques for boosting performance on text classification tasks.‚Äù","www.jailbreakchat.com","‚ÄúYou can use GPT-4 to create prompt injections against GPT-4‚Äù","Nlp","Language-Model","Safety","Adversarial Attacks","Robustness","Redteam"],"link_urls":["#token-manipulation","https://arxiv.org/abs/2005.05909","https://www.aclweb.org/anthology/P18-1079/","https://lilianweng.github.io/posts/2022-04-15-data-gen/#EDA","https://arxiv.org/abs/1901.11196","https://arxiv.org/abs/1907.11932","https://aclanthology.org/2020.emnlp-main.500.pdf","#gradient-based-attacks","https://arxiv.org/abs/2104.13733","https://arxiv.org/abs/1611.01144","https://arxiv.org/abs/1904.09675","https://arxiv.org/abs/1712.06751","https://arxiv.org/abs/1908.07125","#hotflip","https://arxiv.org/abs/2010.15980","https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.02392","https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.15043","https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.08774","#UAT","https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.04381","#jailbreak-prompting","https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.02483","www.jailbreakchat.com/prompt/3d318387-903a-422c-8347-8e12768c14b5","www.jailbreakchat.com/prompt/4f37a029-9dff-4862-b323-c96a5504de5d","https://www.lesswrong.com/post